	(text "Only LEDs, buzzer and OLED are on the panel. Other units are on the Main Board.\nDashed line divide this 2 type of units. Left side is on the Main Board, while right side is on the panel.\n\nRed LED, V_{f}=2(V), R=150, I=8.7(mA)\nRed LED, V_{f}=2(V), R=150, I=8.7(mA)\nBlue LED, V_{f}=3(V), R=33(Ohm), I=9.1(mA)\nBlue LED, V_{f}=3(V), R=33(Ohm), I=9.1(mA)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
